= International Relations

America's alliances and reputation affect both security and economic stability.

- @allies_trip: Tour allied capitals
- @human_rights: Champion human rights and democracy abroad
- @america_first_lite: Emphasize domestic priorities
- @easy_discard

@allies_trip
on-arrival: intl_relation += 8; moderate_strength += 2; progressive_dissent += 1; month_actions += 1

Our leaders reassure allies that American democracy remains reliable.

@human_rights
on-arrival: intl_relation += 4; progressive_strength += 2; pro_democracy += 1; biz_relation -= 2; month_actions += 1

We put democracy and rights at the heart of foreign policy.

@america_first_lite
on-arrival: intl_relation -= 3; working_dem += 3*(1-dissent); rural_dem += 2*(1-dissent); populist_strength += 3; moderate_dissent += 2; month_actions += 1

We say charity begins at home. The foreign-policy establishment groans.
